id=990oc_boot
name=990 OC - Boot Restore
version=v2.0
versionCode=20
author=cameleonnbss
description=Re-applies the last 990 OC configuration at every boot (Exynos 990 Galaxy S20). Requires the 990 OC app with "Apply at boot" enabled so /data/adb/990oc/boot_apply.sh exists. Log: /data/local/tmp/990oc_boot.log
